# A NuPatch issued inside FrameBegin/FrameEnd before any WorldBegin --
# the "F"-only block state cmdNuPatch's W|A|T|S|O|M mask excludes
# (gmangraphicstate.cpp). uknot/vknot are well-formed (the declared
# nu+uorder/nv+vorder lengths) so parseNuPatch's own knot-length check
# does not intercept this first; allowed(cmdNuPatch) reports RIE_ILLSTATE
# and RiNuPatchV returns before its own validation runs, after
# parseNuPatch's knot arrays are already owned: the one fixture proving
# the parser frees them when the request is ignored.
#
# Along with nupatch_singular_ctm.rib, this is one of the two
# malformed/nupatch_*.rib fixtures not followed by a Sphere: the file has
# nothing to render and gman exits 0 after the one warning.
FrameBegin 1
NuPatch 2 2 [0 0 1 1] 0 1 2 2 [0 0 1 1] 0 1
	"P" [-1 -1 0  1 -1 0  -1 1 0  1 1 0]
FrameEnd
